d a design patterns book expecting dry UML diagrams and monotone prose, Head First Design Patterns will catch you off guard in the best way. This is a book that treats \\\"learning\\\" a\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.hashnode.com/uploads/covers/640cddfdb1e4eb4512040ddf/58280dd7-3e04-48aa-8927-234d86be294c.png?w=800\u0026h=420\u0026auto=compress,format\u0026format=webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-13T09:48:03.254Z\",\"wordCount\":1000,\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Arish Ahmad\",\"url\":\"https://hashnode.com/@ArishAhmad\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Hashnode\",\"url\":\"https://hashnode.com\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Onboarding was doing two jobs. I think AI removed only one.\",\"url\":\"https://mayankkaul.hashnode.dev/onboarding-was-doing-two-jobs-i-think-ai-removed-only-one\",\"description\":\"The expensive part of working in another team's service was never writing the code. Writing fifty lines has never taken a week. What took the week was building enough of a model of the service that th\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.hashnode.com/uploads/covers/6a6fc5c97251405a9467eefe/1f3e2bbe-42ea-4007-9dd6-c9bf94393335.png?w=800\u0026h=420\u0026auto=compress,format\u0026format=webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-02T23:04:55.793Z\",\"wordCount\":1500,\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"mayank\",\"url\":\"https://hashnode.com/@mayankkaul\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Hashnode\",\"url\":\"https://hashnode.com\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"The agent fixed one hang, then immediately wrote another.\",\"url\":\"https://blog.mindrealm.ai/the-agent-fixed-one-hang-then-immediately-wrote-another\",\"description\":\"Mindrealm flagged a health check that could hang forever. It used the default HTTP client without a timeout, so if a server accepted the connection and never replied, it would sit